                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Upsides:\n\npermanent death makes you actually want to avoid dying\nvery team oriented (game gets easier the more players there are)\nyou can still die in a large group without skill (encouraged building skills)\nfairly easy to upgrade your character\nloot is shared (no hoarding)\nsecret areas (rewards exploration)\n\nDownsides:\n\nsome maps are very easy to die in (causing you to lose all progress)\nrandom loot drops make it difficult to get good modifiers on weapons\nvery niche community with very little info (especially on wiki)\nno more planned updates (no new content to look forward too, game gets repetitive)",
